# Trial-Size Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_earth): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Earth_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). EP_Entrance with the clearance and the entry item gone: checkRequirements as
# no registrant fails: the handler returns nothing: the default.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/Earth_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Bastok.TrialSizeTrialByEarth accepted
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfEarth
login
trade EP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfEarth x1  # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                   # the fight, arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Earth_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Earth_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -538.4,0.455,-493.9 CloisterOfTremors
trigger EP_Entrance                     # the clearance, the entry item gone: the default
